    IDS_DL_WARN_FILE        "While files from the Internet can be useful, some files can potentially harm your computer. If you do not trust the source, do not open or save this file."
    IDS_DL_WARN_UNKNOWN     "While files from the Internet can be useful, some files can potentially harm your computer. If you do not trust the source, do not save this file."
    IDS_DL_BTN_RUN          "&Run"
    IDS_DL_TYPE_UNKNOWN     "Unknown File Type"
    IDS_DL_TYPE_SIZE        "%s, %s"
